      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的憧憬看上去充满了稚嫩感，\n某种程度上，也可以说是不够脚踏实地——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a0bcebcc25d1143eb58f3c70577bd0292b79e579db81807d2c54211d42abf83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
