    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbec64b3bb94e7c09cd2c366",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『在古马级赛事中，每当后冠路线和三冠路线\n的赛马娘们产生激烈竞争时，几乎都是前者落败』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ef2398189ba1005a9096e75edc5f758beb31b205f75a53fb1826d9f5381fed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
